  - Assets/GameAsset/Sprite/Icon/Item
  - Assets/GameAsset/Sprite/Icon/Monster
  - Assets/GameAsset/Sprite/Icon/PlayerHead
  - Assets/GameAsset/Sprite/UI/7Day
  - Assets/GameAsset/Sprite/UI/Abilities
  - Assets/GameAsset/Sprite/UI/Alliance
  - Assets/GameAsset/Sprite/UI/Battle
  - Assets/GameAsset/Sprite/UI/BattleMain
  - Assets/GameAsset/Sprite/UI/BattlePass
